    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the Micron MT35 ASP vendor-private opcodes and constants. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Micron MT35 OCTAL/QUAD NOR Advanced Sector Protection (ASP) vendor-private opcodes and constants. These are the command opcodes, dummy cycle counts, password width, and the Sector Protection Register (SPR) one-time programmable (OTP) lock bit. Only <ref refid="xilsfl__micron__asp_8c" kindref="compound">xilsfl_micron_asp.c</ref> includes this file, and it is not part of the public xilsfl API.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who Date     Changes
<hruler/>

1.3   sb  07/20/26  Initial support for Advanced Sector Protection.
